The numbers is a list of 0 and 1.
The last is the last position of numbers.
The width is last plus 1.
The flags is a list of 5 zeros.
The firsts is a list of 5 zeros.
Set item width of flags to 1.
Set item width of firsts to -1.
The running is 0.
The best is 0.
For every spot from 0 to last.
The step is -1.
If item spot of numbers is 1, set step to 1.
Set running to running plus step.
The key is running plus width.
If item key of flags is 0, set item key of flags to 1, set item key of firsts to spot.
The stretch is spot minus item key of firsts.
If item key of flags is 1 and stretch is more than best, set best to stretch.

Show best.
